{"id": 63425, "date": "2025-12-26T04:00:28", "date_gmt": "2025-12-26T12:00:28", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63425"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:28:52", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:28:52", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-26-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/26/kingdom-of-days-december-26-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 26"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce drops by the Bottom Line in New York City to catch Patti Smith&#8217;s late show, providing backing vocals for &#8220;Gloria.&#8221;</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6749\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-1226/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1226.jpg?fit=314%2C200&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"314,200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-1226\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1226.jpg?fit=314%2C200&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6749 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1226.jpg?resize=314%2C200&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1226.jpg?w=314&amp;ssl=1 314w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1226.jpg?resize=300%2C191&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 314px) 100vw, 314px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1995:\u00a0</strong>Bruce announces an extension of his solo acoustic tour in the new year, with select dates in North America before heading overseas.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"31925\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1995-12-2t6/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?fit=794%2C1160&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,1160\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1995-12-2t6\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?fit=701%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-31925 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?resize=758%2C1107&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"1107\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?resize=205%2C300&amp;ssl=1 205w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?resize=701%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 701w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1995-12-2t6.jpg?resize=768%2C1122&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>2017:\u00a0</strong>Patti Scialfa is sick with the flu and cannot perform, throwing a monkey wrench into the <em>Springsteen on Broadway\u00a0</em>storyline and set list. Bruce adapts by changing that part of the show to focus on his kids instead of his wife, and accordingly, &#8220;Long Time Comin'&#8221; makes its first appearance in the show, in the spot where &#8220;Tougher Than the Rest&#8221; would normally be. Bruce also swaps out &#8220;Brilliant Disguise&#8221; for &#8220;The Ghost of Tom Joad,&#8221; giving added weight to the segment on his social values.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>Bruce makes his first guest appearance with Patti Smith, and Patti Scialfa misses her first Broadway show with Bruce. </p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 6062, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_access": "", "_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content": false, "_jetpack_feature_clip_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content": false, "footnotes": "", "jetpack_publicize_message": "", "jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled": true, "jetpack_social_post_already_shared": true, "jetpack_social_options": {"image_generator_settings": {"template": "highway", "default_image_id": 0, "font": "", "enabled": false}, "version": 2}, "jetpack_post_was_ever_published": false}, "categories": [2], "tags": [630, 115, 1071, 273], "class_list": ["post-63425", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "has-post-thumbnail", "hentry", "category-kingdom-of-days", "tag-new-york-city", "tag-patti-scialfa", "tag-patti-smith", "tag-springsteen-on-broadway"], "aioseo_notices": [], "aioseo_head": "\n\t\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-image-preview:large\" />\n\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Ken\"/>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/index.p